<title>USA: Lexington-Fayette UCGPFC, Ky., won by JJB Hilliard.</title>
<headline>Lexington-Fayette UCGPFC, Ky., won by JJB Hilliard.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>J.J.B Hilliard, W.L. Lyons, Inc. said it won $4.350 million of Lexington-Fayette Urban Cty Government Public Facilities Corp., Ky., equipment lease revenue notes, Series 1997, with a net interest cost of 4.578 percent.</p>
</text>
